    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90160" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστήκομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, with pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστέτηκα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stick fast to, cling to</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστᾰκέντος ἰοῦ</span>, of the poisoned robe
				<i>clinging to</i> Heracles, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				833
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδρας προστετᾱκὼς
			φάσματι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				836
			</span></i> (lyr.): metaph., <i>to be given up to, engrossed by</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορισμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.524d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀνιαροῖς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				600c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					3.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Κριτίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					2.1.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					7.226a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς αἱρέσεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.657
				</span></i>
			.</div>
